  "description": "The original adult human monk, stern pale clean-shaven face inside a close dark forest-green cloth hood with pale inner face border and a short floppy backward point. Long coarse dark green robe with broad sleeves, crossed forearms hidden inside opposite sleeves in standing poses, narrow white-gray rope belt with two long knotted ends hanging at front. Small dark brown-black shoes under the ankle-length hem. Preserve the native narrow body, folded arms, hood shape and shaded green fabric. No staff, weapon, jewelry, armor, magical effects or extra ornaments. Only the green cloth recolors to the native gray-violet and deep red variants; face, rope and shoes remain protected.",
